@startuml 03-observer
!include style.iuml
title Observer Pattern - Donations, Events and Distributions
!include model.iuml
remove *
restore Subject
restore Observer
restore ChangeEvent
restore ChangeType
restore DonationService
restore EventService
restore DistributionService
restore ReceiptObserver
restore ThankYouObserver
restore StatsObserver
restore AttendeeNotificationObserver
restore StockObserver
restore ActivityLog
restore NotificationService
note top of Subject : <b>Subject</b> (publisher)
note top of Observer : <b>Observer</b> (subscriber)\nupdate(source, change)
note bottom of DonationService : <b>Concrete Subjects</b>\nevery change -> notifyObservers(new ChangeEvent(...))
note bottom of ActivityLog : <b>Concrete Observers</b> subscribe themselves\n(constructor or watch() calls subject.addObserver(this))
@enduml
